{"meta":{"version":1,"generated":"2026-11-01","fingerprint":"416f5271f684c2e7","units":"m, body weights"},"examples":[{"id":"ex1","title":"The intermediate crimp","lesson":"A long gap with one small crimp on the way: reach it or work for it.","text":["Between the start jugs and the next jug J1 there is a long gap. The only thing in it is a small crimp, C, off to the side, and there are no footholds between the floor and the high ones.","{B.label} is tall enough to reach J1 straight from the start, with the feet still low (crux {B.crux}). {A.label} is not: she pulls onto the crimp with both hands, steps her feet up to the high footholds, and reaches J1 from there. It works, but at her limit (crux {A.crux}).","{C.label} gets a hand onto the crimp but is {C.fail}. With one hand on a crimp and both feet to one side, the body needs a little grip twist to stay square, and a weak grip on a small edge cannot give it: a barn-door.","{D.label} cannot use the crimp at all ({D.fail}), and without it J1 is out of reach."],"route":{"id":"ex1","title":"The intermediate crimp","lesson":"","wall":{"w":3.0,"h":4.2},"holds":[{"id":"S1","x":1.35,"y":1.45,"type":"jug","dir":90.0,"use":"both","role":"start"},{"id":"S2","x":1.65,"y":1.45,"type":"jug","dir":90.0,"use":"both","role":"start"},{"id":"C","x":1.25,"y":2.25,"type":"crimp","dir":90.0,"use":"both","role":"normal"},{"id":"J1","x":1.55,"y":2.6,"type":"jug","dir":90.0,"use":"both","role":"normal"},{"id":"J2","x":1.45,"y":3.05,"type":"jug","dir":90.0,"use":"both","role":"normal"},{"id":"T","x":1.55,"y":3.45,"type":"jug","dir":90.0,"use":"both","role":"finish"},{"id":"F1","x":1.3,"y":0.5,"type":"foot_big","dir":90.0,"use":"foot","role":"normal"},{"id":"F2","x":1.7,"y":0.5,"type":"foot_big","dir":90.0,"use":"foot","role":"normal"},{"id":"F3","x":1.25,"y":1.75,"type":"foot_big","dir":90.0,"use":"foot","role":"normal"},{"id":"F4","x":1.75,"y":1.8,"type":"foot_big","dir":90.0,"use":"foot","role":"normal"}],"start_hands":["S1","S2"],"finish